    <string name="privacy_section_collect">WHAT WE COLLECT</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_collect">Your display name, handicap index, home course, and pace-of-play preference — all editable under Personal Details and Playing Details — plus the identity Firebase issues when you sign in with Google. Your language preference (Profile → Language) is stored only on this device, not on the server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_usage">HOW IT\'S USED</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_usage">To show you nearby tee times, match you with rounds, and let hosts see who\'s requesting to join. It isn\'t sold or shared with third parties.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_controls">YOUR CONTROLS</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_controls">You can edit or clear your profile fields any time under Personal Details / Playing Details, and sign out below. In-app account deletion isn\'t available yet — request it directly from the team in the meantime.</string>
